{"id":"633f67d630a481ae","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-orthonormal.md","title":"Orthonormal","display":"df-orthonormal — Orthonormal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-orthonormal","aliases":["58-df-orthonormal","Orthonormal"],"display":"df-orthonormal — Orthonormal","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-linear-independence.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-orthonormal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-orthonormal</span><span>Orthonormal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-orthonormal — Orthonormal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce5a656462edb0c9\" href=\"?note=ce5a656462edb0c9\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md\">../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d7572fcd49aca9c8\" href=\"?note=d7572fcd49aca9c8\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-linear-independence.md\">../batch05/58-df-linear-independence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb0e606138cd791a\" href=\"?note=bb0e606138cd791a\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md\">../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot,B\\in V\">\\(e,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot,B\\in V\\)</span> (indexed family and inner-product-space data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrthonormalStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{OrthonormalStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthonormal}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthonormal}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrthonormalStructure}_S(e,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,I,H)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(B(e(i),e(j))=\\delta_{ij}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrthonormalStructure}_S(e,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,I,H)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(B(e(i),e(j))=\\delta_{ij}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Orthonormal}_S(e,I,H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_H,\\odot,B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrthonormalStructure}_S(e,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Orthonormal}_S(e,I,H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_H,\\odot,B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrthonormalStructure}_S(e,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Orthonormal: orthogonal and unit length relative to an explicitly witnessed inner-product structure.</li>\n<li>Gram-Schmidt: construct orthonormal from any set</li>\n<li>Complete orthonormal basis properties are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb0e606138cd791a\" href=\"?note=bb0e606138cd791a\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md\">../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce5a656462edb0c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-linear-independence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d7572fcd49aca9c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-linear-independence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb0e606138cd791a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb0e606138cd791a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Complete orthonormal basis properties are defined in [[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrthonormalStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthonormal}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrthonormalStructure}_S(e,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,I,H)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(B(e(i),e(j))=\\delta_{ij}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Orthonormal}_S(e,I,H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_H,\\odot,B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrthonormalStructure}_S(e,I,H,k,+_H,\\odot,B)","display":true}],"bytes":1570,"backlinks":[{"id":"6cd8ac9e1db76366","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-928","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-orthonormal.md|58-df-orthonormal]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["ce5a656462edb0c9","d7572fcd49aca9c8","bb0e606138cd791a","36d7463d215be751"]}